  "description": {
   "en": "Planet 'Blood Cell' - a world created by the God of Death. Though populated by diverse plants, animals, and humans, this deity who revels in conflict designed it with one cruel rule: survival is only possible through blood consumption. For a millennium, this system bred endless conflict between beings desperate to survive. But now, after 1000 years, champions arise who will finally end this blood-soaked world ruled by greed!"
